    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:01.900" end="00:04.810" ttm:agent="v1">I see you from across the room</p>
      <p begin="00:04.810" end="00:07.610" ttm:agent="v1">I thought I wouldn't feel a thing</p>
      <p begin="00:07.610" end="00:10.620" ttm:agent="v1">I think it's gettin' colder now</p>
      <p begin="00:10.620" end="00:13.330" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna get close to you</p>
      <p begin="00:13.330" end="00:16.490" ttm:agent="v1">I swear that we've been here before</p>
      <p begin="00:16.490" end="00:19.180" ttm:agent="v1">I guess you didn't notice me</p>
      <p begin="00:19.180" end="00:21.870" ttm:agent="v1">But you do now</p>
      <p begin="00:21.870" end="00:25.250" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, you do now</p>
      <p begin="00:25.250" end="00:28.100" ttm:agent="v1">What are you waitin' for?</p>
      <p begin="00:28.100" end="00:30.730" ttm:agent="v1">What are you waitin' for?</p>
      <p begin="00:30.730" end="00:33.640" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I've been standin' here</p>
      <p begin="00:33.640" end="00:36.760" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I've been standin' here</p>
      <p begin="00:36.760" end="00:39.690" ttm:agent="v1">What are you waitin' for?</p>
      <p begin="00:39.690" end="00:42.480" ttm:agent="v1">What are you waitin' for?</p>
      <p begin="00:42.480" end="00:45.100" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I've been standin' here</p>
      <p begin="00:45.100" end="00:48.790" ttm:agent="v1">It's never been so clear</p>
      <p begin="00:48.790" end="00:51.860" ttm:agent="v1">I get it if you wanna wait, 'cause I'll stay in my place</p>
      <p begin="00:51.860" end="00:54.440" ttm:agent="v1">I ain't got nowhere to go, I got plenty time to waste</p>
      <p begin="00:54.440" end="00:57.590" ttm:agent="v1">I think I've fallen in love, but that's not enough</p>
      <p begin="00:57.590" end="01:00.990" ttm:agent="v1">If you don't feel the same, I guess I'll leave you alone, but</p>
      <p begin="01:00.990" end="01:03.830" ttm:agent="v1">It's time and time again, babe, you're never listenin', babe</p>
      <p begin="01:03.830" end="01:06.500" ttm:agent="v1">If there's no promise made, I don't ever wanna fall in love</p>
      <p begin="01:06.500" end="01:11.570" ttm:agent="v1">I don't ever wanna mess it up, we're runnin' out of luck</p>
      <p begin="01:11.570" end="01:14.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">What are you waitin' for? (For)</p>
      <p begin="01:14.390" end="01:17.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">What are you waitin' for? (For)</p>
      <p begin="01:17.270" end="01:20.090" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I've been standin' here</p>
      <p begin="01:20.090" end="01:22.940" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I've been standin' here</p>
      <p begin="01:22.940" end="01:25.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">What are you waitin' for? (Why do you wait? Why do you wait?)</p>
      <p begin="01:25.800" end="01:28.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">What are you waitin' for? (Why do you wait? Why do you wait?)</p>
      <p begin="01:28.710" end="01:31.590" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I've been standin' here</p>
      <p begin="01:31.590" end="01:36.310" ttm:agent="v1">It's never been so clear</p>
      <p begin="01:36.310" end="01:39.020" ttm:agent="v1">Why do you wait? Why do you wait?</p>
      <p begin="01:39.020" end="01:42.100" ttm:agent="v1">Why do you wait? Why do you wait?</p>
      <p begin="01:42.100" end="01:44.830" ttm:agent="v1">Why do you wait? Why do you wait?</p>
      <p begin="01:44.830" end="01:47.350" ttm:agent="v1">Why do you wait? Why do you wait?</p>
      <p begin="01:47.350" end="01:50.100" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me to stay, you're wastin' my time</p>
      <p begin="01:50.100" end="01:53.120" ttm:agent="v1">Every day I'm waitin' in line</p>
      <p begin="01:53.120" end="01:56.020" ttm:agent="v1">Standing in place, 'cause, baby, that's all I know</p>
      <p begin="01:56.020" end="01:57.850" ttm:agent="v1">Why do you wait? Just tell me</p>
      <p begin="01:57.850" end="02:00.620" ttm:agent="v1">What are you waitin' for?</p>
      <p begin="02:00.620" end="02:03.560" ttm:agent="v1">What are you waitin' for?</p>
      <p begin="02:03.560" end="02:06.200" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I've been standin' here</p>
      <p begin="02:06.200" end="02:09.290" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I've been standin' here</p>
      <p begin="02:09.290" end="02:12.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">What are you waitin' for? (Why do you wait? Why do you wait?)</p>
      <p begin="02:12.350" end="02:14.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">What are you waitin' for? (Why do you wait? Why do you wait?)</p>
      <p begin="02:14.880" end="02:17.890" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I've been standin' here</p>
      <p begin="02:17.890" end="02:22.350" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I've been standin' here, oh</p>
      <p begin="02:22.350" end="02:26.350" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
